WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.302
-Here at "Late Night,"
every night,

00:00:03.302 --> 00:00:05.371
I deliver a monologue
comprised of jokes

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:06.672
written by a diverse team
of writers.

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:09.008
As a result, a lot of jokes
come across my desk that,

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:10.844
due to my being
a straight white male,

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:12.278
would be difficult
for me to deliver,

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:15.381
but we don't think that should
stop you from enjoying them.

00:00:15.381 --> 00:00:16.949
So we'd like
to share them with you now

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:19.185
in a segment called
"Jokes Seth Can't Tell."

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:22.521
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:22.521 --> 00:00:24.591
Hey, everybody,
these are two of our writers,

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:25.792
Amber and Jenny.

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:27.494
-I'm black.
-And I'm gay.

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:29.829
-And we're both women.
-And I'm not.

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:31.697
So, here's how this works.

00:00:31.697 --> 00:00:33.766
I will read the setups
for these jokes,

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:36.236
and then Amber and Jenny
will read the punch lines.

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:37.937
Here we go.

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:40.873
A Virginia woman was arrested
for public intoxication

00:00:40.873 --> 00:00:43.576
last week after she was spotted
carrying a suitcase

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:45.444
with three cats inside.

00:00:45.444 --> 00:00:48.748
-Said lesbians, "Three?
Where are the rest of her cats?"

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:50.849
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.849 --> 00:00:53.486
-"Esquire" magazine recently
featured a profile

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:57.023
on the hardships of growing up
white, middle class, and male.

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:59.825
-Said black people,
"Ooh! Fiction."

00:00:59.825 --> 00:01:02.662
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:06.332
-According to new data,
American women

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:08.267
are now more educated than ever.

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:10.670
-And if they get
just a little smarter,

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:12.305
they'll stop dating men.

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:15.008
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:17.143
-President Trump
said this weekend

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:19.912
that he thinks African-Americans
like him a lot.

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:21.948
-No word yet
on who told him that.

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:22.948
It was Kanye.

00:01:22.948 --> 00:01:25.251
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:28.188
-And, Amber, real quick,
are you a Kanye fan?

00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:30.590
-I was until he died.
-Oh, he's not dead.

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:31.924
-He's dead to me.

00:01:31.924 --> 00:01:37.796
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:37.796 --> 00:01:39.332
-A new lesbian romance

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:41.200
starring Kate Winslet
and Saiorse Ronan

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.135
is facing backlash
from people who say

00:01:43.135 --> 00:01:45.604
the women it's based on
weren't really gay.

00:01:45.604 --> 00:01:48.641
-Said lesbians,
"Shh! Just let them make it."

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:50.643
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:52.411
-Jenny, do you like
watching things

00:01:52.411 --> 00:01:53.712
with lesbian protagonists?

00:01:53.712 --> 00:01:56.316
-Yes!
That's why I love this show.

00:01:56.316 --> 00:02:00.219
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.219 --> 00:02:02.054
-According to a new report,
white people

00:02:02.054 --> 00:02:04.624
are primarily responsible
for carbon emissions.

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:07.360
-But a black guy's
already in jail for it.

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:14.733
[ Laughter, audience groans ]

00:02:14.733 --> 00:02:16.603
-"Oh, man!
I drive a Prius!"

00:02:16.603 --> 00:02:18.771
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:21.140
March is Women's History Month.

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:24.143
-So celebrate by giving women
what they want most --

00:02:24.143 --> 00:02:26.812
-Quiet tampon wrappers.

00:02:26.812 --> 00:02:27.847
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:30.716
-I don't --
I don't understand.

00:02:30.716 --> 00:02:33.219
-Every time a woman
tries to quietly

00:02:33.219 --> 00:02:35.855
take tampon out of her purse,
it sounds like this.

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:39.592
CKCKCKCKCKCKCK!
-Ckkckkckk!

00:02:39.592 --> 00:02:40.727
-Ckk!
-Ckkk!

00:02:40.727 --> 00:02:41.860
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.860 --> 00:02:43.262
-I thought you guys
were eating popcorn.

00:02:43.262 --> 00:02:46.766
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:48.000
Wait!

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.036
Wait. This next joke is about
an Asian woman.

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:51.604
You guys can't tell this joke.

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:54.140
-No.
But our new writer Karen can.

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:56.509
-Hi, everybody!
-Oh, great.

00:02:56.509 --> 00:03:00.413
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:00.413 --> 00:03:02.548
-Do you think
she can handle it?

00:03:02.548 --> 00:03:05.384
-Oh, can she handle
reading out loud?

00:03:05.384 --> 00:03:07.754
Like your job's so hard.
-Right.

00:03:07.754 --> 00:03:09.188
Fine. All right.

00:03:09.188 --> 00:03:12.225
Naomi Osaka recently became
the first Asian tennis player

00:03:12.225 --> 00:03:13.926
to be ranked
number one in the world.

00:03:13.926 --> 00:03:15.995
-Said her mother,
"That'll look great

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:18.197
on your application
for medical school."

00:03:18.197 --> 00:03:19.265
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:22.601
-All right.
Yeah!

00:03:22.601 --> 00:03:24.403
That was great, Karen.

00:03:24.403 --> 00:03:25.538
-Gee, thanks, Seth.

00:03:25.538 --> 00:03:27.874
It was really hard
reading those words.

00:03:27.874 --> 00:03:30.977
I don't know
how you do it, Seth.

00:03:30.977 --> 00:03:33.045
[ Laughter ]

00:03:33.045 --> 00:03:35.381
-She learned to be mean to me
from you two!

00:03:35.381 --> 00:03:37.717
-[ Laughing ]

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:39.886
A company in Australia
is allowing employees

00:03:39.886 --> 00:03:42.355
to take 12 weeks
of life leave per year,

00:03:42.355 --> 00:03:44.724
which can be used
for travel or relaxing.

00:03:44.724 --> 00:03:47.527
-While a company in America
will give women a half day

00:03:47.527 --> 00:03:49.062
if they give birth
at their desk.

00:03:49.062 --> 00:03:51.464
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.464 --> 00:03:53.666
-A court in Michigan
ruled yesterday

00:03:53.666 --> 00:03:56.201
that giving the middle finger
to a police officer

00:03:56.201 --> 00:03:58.137
is an act of free speech.

00:03:58.137 --> 00:04:01.139
-Said black people, "You first."

00:04:01.139 --> 00:04:06.412
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:06.412 --> 00:04:08.347
-Hey, Seth,
why don't you tell one?

00:04:08.347 --> 00:04:10.649
-Oh, no, I couldn't!
-Come on! Just one.

00:04:10.649 --> 00:04:12.751
-I feel like
I'll get in trouble if do I one.

00:04:12.751 --> 00:04:13.953
-Oh, come on. Do it!

00:04:13.953 --> 00:04:16.155
-Okay, I will,
'cause I trust you both.

00:04:16.155 --> 00:04:17.824
-Great.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:17.824 --> 00:04:20.559
The head of NASA claimed
in an interview last week

00:04:20.559 --> 00:04:23.629
that the first person on Mars
is likely to be a woman.

00:04:23.629 --> 00:04:27.333
And then, if it's safe,
they'll send the men.

00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:31.036
-How dare you!
-You told me it would be okay!

00:04:31.036 --> 00:04:32.505
-You should be
ashamed of yourself!

00:04:32.505 --> 00:04:36.842
-You wrote that for me today
and handed it to me at my desk!

00:04:36.842 --> 00:04:39.145
Lesbians and black women
are liars!

00:04:39.145 --> 00:04:43.116
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:43.116 --> 00:04:45.751
We'll be right back
with Issa Rae, everybody!

00:04:45.751 --> 00:04:48.020
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:49.422
♪♪

